<title>NEW ZEALAND: PARAPINE TO CHANGE NAME TO COUNTERPOINT.</title>
<headline>PARAPINE TO CHANGE NAME TO COUNTERPOINT.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parapine Timber New Zealand said on Thursday it would change its name to Counterpoint Equities Limited.</p>
<p>Details of the timing of the name change would be advised shortly, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Parapine also said the limited due diligence conditions in the agreements it had entered into to acquire a majority shareholding in Dairy Brands NZ had been satisfied.</p>
<p>Accordingly, non-refundable deposits of NZ$50,000 in total would be paid on Thursday to the vendors of the shares in Dairy Brands.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
